  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-15\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 15</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>Les dispositions des articles 2, 4, 5, 6,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"9°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">9°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>7, 8, 9,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>et 10 sont applicables aux contrats conclus ou renouvelés après l'entrée en vigueur de cette loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>La période de neuf ans, prévue à l'article 9,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>ne peut commencer avant la date de l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>Les dispositions des articles 3, 6,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">6°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>9,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>12, 13 et 14 sont applicables aux contrats en cours au moment de l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 4.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'article 6,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">7°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>est applicable aux congés donnés par le bailleur après l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 5.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'article 6,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">8°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>est applicable aux contrats de courte durée conclus, prorogés ou renouvelés après l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 6.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'article 6,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"10°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">10°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>est applicable aux congés donnés après l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 7.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'article 11 est applicable en cas de transfert de propriété survenu après l'entrée en vigueur de la présente loi.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
